<title>USA: IOWA-SO MINN HOGS ESTIMATE TUESDAY 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>IOWA-SO MINN HOGS ESTIMATE TUESDAY 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Tuesday were 110,000 head, compared with 115,000 a week ago and 97,000 a year ago, USDA reported. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts sold steady with midsession Monday.</p>
<p>Trade and demand was light to moderate. Offerings moderate.</p>
